    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Background</h2><p>Born in the Scottish highlands in 1631 and Embraced by a 7th-generation @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.clans.JournalEntry.ZFYurbvAHfaRguYI]{Brujah} after a skirmish against Cromwell's forces, Jeremy MacNeil fought for Irish freedom, then American independence, before @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.clans.JournalEntry.OpCOs3PLjmtl0QVu]{Ventrue} expansion pushed him ever westward to Los Angeles. When Don Sebastian's goons savagely beat him for defying the Prince, the resulting anarch outcry became the spark of the 1944 Revolt. Jeremy, Salvador Garcia, Crispus Attucks, and Marguerite Foccart led the uprising that destroyed Don Sebastian and founded the Anarch Free States, a stretch of California from the Mexican border to San Jose governed by no prince.</p><h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>A committed anarchist, Jeremy has little interest in personally governing and strongly resists both his own accretion of power and any other Kindred's attempts to rule. He believes the strong proving themselves in a free society will eventually create genuine Kindred brotherhood. He reserved the San Fernando Valley and central Los Angeles as neutral, baron-free territory for himself and defended it with his coterie. He tolerates Smiling Jack's disruptive presence in the Free States out of reluctance to give the anarchs orders, though it worries him. Unknown to Jeremy, Christopher Houghton (a hidden @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.clans.JournalEntry.GaCuLGcjZZjf2EO6]{Toreador} elder secretly infatuated with him) has been the true unseen power protecting the Free States since their founding.</p>",
    "notes": "Haven: heavily guarded estate off Mulholland Drive in the Hollywood Hills, and a second haven beneath City Hall. Survived an @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.clans.JournalEntry.WaQFCEXFzv8YeAgX]{Assamite} assassination contract from the @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.sects.JournalEntry.fc464242d84d4e34]{Camarilla}'s Inner Circle in 1955 (with Crispus Attucks). Secretly the object of the ancient @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.clans.JournalEntry.GaCuLGcjZZjf2EO6]{Toreador} Christopher Houghton's infatuation and protection.",
    "npcType": "vampire"
  },
